      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">أَلْغَبَهُ</span></b>  <i>He fatigued, tired,</i> or <i>wearied him.</i>
(S, K.) ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b2-  Also, and ↓ <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">تلغّبهُ</span></b>  and ↓ <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">لغّبهُ</span></b> , <i>It</i> (journeying, or travel,) <i>fatigued, tired,</i> or <i>wearied,
